{"id":357,"date":"2021-07-13T20:47:34","date_gmt":"2021-07-13T20:47:34","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/?p=357"},"modified":"2026-05-22T19:31:12","modified_gmt":"2026-05-22T19:31:12","slug":"musiqology-branding","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2021\/07\/13\/musiqology-branding\/","title":{"rendered":"Musiqology (Branding)"},"content":{"rendered":"\r\n<figure>\r\n<h3>Musiqology \u2014 Brand Identity<\/h3>\r\n<p><br \/>Role: In-House Creative Scope: Brand Identity Design<\/p>\r\n<p><br \/><strong>Overview<\/strong><br \/>Musiqology was an editorial platform celebrating music, culture, and scholarship \u2014 anchored by the work of Dr. Guthrie Ramsey and the artists in his orbit. Before the platform could publish a single word, it needed a visual identity that could carry the weight of that mission.<\/p>\r\n<p><br \/><strong>The Work<\/strong><br \/>I developed the brand identity system for Musiqology \u2014 logo, color palette, typography, and the overall look and feel \u2014 and extended that system into promotional graphics for Dr. Ramsey&#8217;s live shows and events.<\/p>\r\n<p>That last part was critical. A brand that only lives on a website is incomplete \u2014 Musiqology needed to show up in the real world, on stage, and in the spaces where the music actually happened. I designed promotional materials that carried the brand&#8217;s visual language into event contexts, creating consistency across digital and physical touchpoints.<\/p>\r\n<p>The design challenge throughout was finding the right balance: credible and culturally serious without being stiff, energetic without being shallow. The identity drew from the richness of Black music tradition while feeling contemporary and forward-looking.<\/p>\r\n<p><br \/><strong>Legacy<\/strong><br \/>Though the original platform is no longer active, the brand evolved into Musiqology Media \u2014 and the foundational identity work created during this period continues to inform the platform&#8217;s visual direction today.<\/p>\r\n<p><br \/><strong>Disciplines<\/strong><br \/>Brand Identity \u00b7 Logo Design \u00b7 Typography \u00b7 Color Systems \u00b7 Event Promotion \u00b7 Print Design \u00b7 Art Direction<\/p>\r\n<\/figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"359\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2021\/07\/13\/musiqology-branding\/bluenotefbbanner2\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/bluenotefbbanner2.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"851,315\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-title=\"bluenotefbbanner2\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/bluenotefbbanner2.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-359\" src=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/bluenotefbbanner2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"815\" height=\"301\" srcset=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/bluenotefbbanner2.jpg 851w, https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/bluenotefbbanner2-300x111.jpg 300w, https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/bluenotefbbanner2-768x284.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 815px) 100vw, 815px\" \/><\/figure>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"650\" height=\"800\" data-attachment-id=\"364\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2021\/07\/13\/musiqology-branding\/bluenote05-1\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/bluenote05-1.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"650,800\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-title=\"bluenote05-1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/202